' Panel (a) of the workflow figure: the eight steps of Algorithm 1 as a UML activity diagram.
' Rendered by paper/figures.py (PlantUML, EPS output, then Ghostscript); a ";" ends an action, so no line of a
' label may end with one. Nimbus Roman is the Times clone of the URW base-35 fonts installed with Ghostscript; Java
' spaces its outlines evenly at this size, which it does not for the hinted Liberation Serif.
@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Nimbus Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActivityBorderColor black
skinparam ActivityBorderThickness 0.8
skinparam ActivityStartColor black
skinparam ActivityEndColor black
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ArrowThickness 0.8

start
:**1. OpenAlex snapshot**
works, authors, venues, yearly citation counts;
:**2. Sample**
48 topics × 250 papers, 2017-2022, and seed papers;
:**3. Reference selection**
at least 2 citing papers; cap, or citers before //T// only;
:**4. Features before //y//**
authors, venue, references: citations received before //y//;
:**5. Graphs**
citation (reference → paper), heterogeneous, venue graph;
:**6. Labels**
citations in years //y// .. //y//+//k//; top 10 % of the cohort;
:**7. Protocols**
mature labels at //T// (primary), retrospective, K-fold, holdout;
:**8. Comparison**
tuned MLP and GNNs; paired differences, 95 % CI;
stop
@enduml
